<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CostCo lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CostCo lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it downgraded Costco Cos Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst Annie Erner said believes stock's recent strong momentum may be tapering if comparable CostCo club sales results decelerate.</p>
<p>-- said stock has risen 31 percent so far in 1997 and now appears fairly valued relative to UBS's expected 16 percent annual earnings per share growth rate.</p>
<p>-- stock was off 1-1/2 to 31.</p>
</text>
